# Rename to CODEOWNERS (no extension) and copy into a repo's root, docs/, or .github/ folder.
# NOT auto-inherited from the org .github repo — GitHub only auto-applies community health
# files org-wide, not CODEOWNERS. Copy this into each repo that wants review auto-assignment.
#
# Format: path-pattern  @owner-or-team
# Requires the referenced team(s) to exist under zsdotcom (see 00-ORG-SETUP-GUIDE.md, section 3)
# and to have at least Read access to this repo, or GitHub will silently skip the assignment.

# Fallback: any file not matched below goes to core-maintainers.
*                       @zsdotcom/maintainers

# Docs-specific ownership, only relevant in docs.zarishsphere.
/content/               @zsdotcom/docs-team
/data/                  @zsdotcom/docs-team
